ny length\n1. Describe the video in **idea**, optionally one shot per line in **shots** (`0-8: text`).\n2. Set **project_seconds**. The Director cuts it into chunks of about 10 s.\n3. Add *NG Context* nodes for pictures, voices, clips or notes and wire them into **contexts**.\n4. The **Start Loop** renders one chunk per iteration; each chunk continues the one before (pinned picture + sound).\n5. **NG Collect** joins everything into one video.\n\nWire both models if you use references: fl2va for text/frames, ref2va for references. Only the one needed is loaded.\n\nRead **warnings** and **plan** on the left after queueing."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## NG Director: a video of any length\n1. Describe the video in **idea**, optionally one shot per line in **shots** (`0-8: text`).\n2. Set **project_seconds**. The Director cuts it into chunks of about 10 s.\n3. Add *NG Context* nodes for pictures, voices, clips or notes and wire them into **contexts**.\n4. The **Start Loop** renders one chunk per iteration; each chunk continues the one before (pinned picture + sound).\n5. **NG Collect** joins everything into one video.\n\nWire both models if you use references: fl2va for text/frames, ref2va for references. Only the one needed is loaded.\n\nRead **warnings** and **plan** on the left after queueing."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[29,5,0,6,3,"NG_CHUNK"],[30,6,3,7,0,"NG_CHUNK"],[31,2,0,7,1,"CLIP"],[32,3,0,7,2,"VAE"],[33,4,0,7,3,"VAE"],[34,6,4,7,6,"LATENT"],[35,1,0,7,4,"MODEL"],[36,6,0,8,0,"INT"],[37,7,0,10,0,"MODEL"],[38,7,0,11,0,"MODEL"],[39,7,1,11,1,"CONDITIONING"],[40,8,0,12,0,"NOISE"],[41,11,0,12,1,"GUIDER"],[42,9,0,12,2,"SAMPLER"],[43,10,0,12,3,"SIGMAS"],[44,7,2,12,4,"LATENT"],[45,12,0,13,0,"LATENT"],[46,12,0,13,1,"LATENT"],[47,13,0,14,0,"LATENT"],[48,5,0,14,1,"NG_CHUNK"],[49,3,0,14,2,"VAE"],[50,4,0,14,3,"VAE"],[51,14,0,15,0,"IMAGE"],[52,14,1,15,1,"AUDIO"],[53,15,0,16,0,"VIDEO"],[54,5,2,17,0,"STRING"],[55,5,1,18,0,"STRING"],[56,14,2,19,0,"STRING"]],